{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1002_p", "source_sha256": "eeb4a28623989c4c9622b56408b4d27b7e2d4ed3df529daf1150cb7d9002ec1c", "ja": "ごめん、百合子。トラブルで待たせちゃったけど\nやっと始められそうだ。", "zh": "抱歉，百合子。因为出了点问题，让你等了这么久，不过总算可以开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "98178afd40319eb64918df3bca4d7a9256563b14cc294ab42aadf9c838e3ad4b", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "01f26f5d06561cc6d1ac7ae3e20769001f25ff69e216b759b91227722ec9cc4d", "ja": "大丈夫です！　時間があったぶん、\nしっかりイメージトレーニングできました♪", "zh": "没问题的！趁着有时间，\n我好好做了一番意象训练♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b01da3baa281c832345af5be166a5ad24b3a8e1002fca4d9627b610c75182182", "ja": "おお、そうなのか。ずいぶん気合いが\n入ってるんだな。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。看来你干劲十足啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "347284f5cf47e0858722c51d95e09d4e7d1659a4a2d0dcd522acc3ea1e791ab1", "ja": "はい！　今日のためにお腹も引き締めてきました。\nへ、へそチラだって、怖くありません！", "zh": "是！为了今天，我还特意收紧了腹部。\n露、露肚脐什么的，我才不怕呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1007_p", "source_sha256": "46379535dcd4e952897e3eff53bc64f34afb8fab6df7955cbefaa23de0d7467b", "ja": "……へそ？", "zh": "……肚脐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "3b085ce10abc5ba2cf125336bf912800c91c5b48d9b2780eed4842d3e23903fb", "ja": "ああっ、もちろん、ちょっと恥ずかしかったりは\nするんですよ？　するんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，当然还是会有点害羞的。会害羞是会害羞，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "a0df3bc0e07ca265cb24b4d8be750ef6bfdc665da875a306ce7df86f766d2946", "ja": "でもファンのみなさんが「へそチラ大事！」「命が助か\nる！」とか言ってて……大事なポイントみたいで。", "zh": "不过，粉丝们都说“露肚脐很重要！”“得救了！”之类的……看来这似乎是个很重要的要点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "4d708e9eb70638b83799094d22cc969e6add1c74658fdcee10a0f33c99cc9eed", "ja": "つまりへそチラは、マイティセーラーの健康美の象徴、\nってことだと思うんです！", "zh": "也就是说，我觉得露肚脐是Mighty Sailor健康美的象征！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4b2d06fdf5006a7ed040f29c7c6208e567945f7cd973cec123b36e024b37c2f5", "ja": "（どの辺りのファンの声だろう……）", "zh": "（这到底是哪一带的粉丝在发言啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "96d3cc53bf4e69f0634f53c0ad1ebcd83ac81a81d4426bca6a277fd6da376bfa", "ja": "それなら恥ずかしがってる場合じゃないですよね！\n強くてキュートなヒーローの魅力を前面に出さないと！", "zh": "既然这样，就不能再害羞了！\n得把坚强又可爱的英雄魅力充分展现出来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ee7b03315ce8051e853de68f5c88c59c63f0fbff7f930ae98ab723324d155442", "ja": "そ、そうだな。ともかく気合いが入っているなら\nよかったよ。いい撮影になりそうだな。", "zh": "对、对啊。总之，你干劲十足就好。看来会是一次很棒的拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "4d9ce59d699ae16f9780dce53faf67487a0e0b5eb45036f27ec71d2a7b4f8dff", "ja": "はい、任せてください！　……あ、ところで、\nトラブルっていうのは大丈夫だったんですか？", "zh": "好的，交给我吧！……啊，对了，之前说的麻烦已经解决了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ad3ee612f6b940dfc8996c3f2e88c259373dbe947e7edd806339b51ce7c4de84", "ja": "ああ、サーキュレーターが不調だったんだけど、\nやっと直ったんだ。ほら、下から風を当てるための。", "zh": "啊，循环扇出了点故障，不过终于修好了。就是那个从下面往上吹风的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "e993b05eb51818491cfff8ba48d303f25f109c33cb5dc315cc2865f3352fb064", "ja": "下から風を当てる……。\nえ？　えっ、そうなんですか？　あの、私の……？", "zh": "从下面吹风……。\n诶？诶，是这样吗？那个，是我的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0633cd6d834e106e28833e1812bfdd2cbe1b96f8f0b6bfb29639f23137e04395", "ja": "うん。……うん？　いや、衣装の躍動感を出すために、\nってたしか前にもやったはず……だよな？", "zh": "嗯。……嗯？不对，为了表现服装的动感，这种事以前好像也做过……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1018_p", "source_sha256": "f248d7a644c79586904dec4b788a4c597970c3b7136f9b02ea2c162a6bf43674", "ja": "も、もちろんインナーがあるし、\nそんな過激な風を当てる予定はないけど！", "zh": "当、当然里面穿了打底，\n我也没打算吹那么过激的风就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "b6b27f008ac33dc13c8abe3d331d0667fa45737f41b773f0f590a36f1ada28dd", "ja": "そういえば……やったような……。\nうう、でも……っ！", "zh": "说起来……好像是做过来着……  \n呜呜，可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "519aded30aa5f750dd5e69f6f5565fb2b8f4f6c7f7fbadb0b0397a811da95509", "ja": "すみません、やっぱり恥ずかしくなってきました！\nちょっと時間をください！", "zh": "对不起，我果然还是觉得有点害羞起来了！\n请给我一点时间！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "20e7cfdf3798c41f3fd9d24eb5cd178f4570791d79518828b1bd2a5b29293888", "ja": "私はヒーロー、私はヒーロー、私はヒーロー、\n私はヒーロー、私はヒーロー、私はヒーロー！", "zh": "我是英雄，我是英雄，我是英雄，\n我是英雄，我是英雄，我是英雄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0683_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0683_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d96d7488dbeb8f6b65f4dc018a7fc5bc532b31c095fedf94d9f5cf42c29c627c", "ja": "わ、わかった、大丈夫だから落ち着くんだ！\n百合子はヒーロー、強くてかっこいい、ヒーロー！", "zh": "我、我知道了，没事的，快冷静下来！\n百合子是英雄，又强大又帅气的英雄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
